out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('**Rows 2 and 4 on both cards are about English and the room will want to put row 4 of each in the other group.** ⚠ **Hold the distinction**: the hedge and the degree are things to write and both were taught, **and what is not about English is whether anybody reads them into a record** — **which is a second item and belongs on the second sheet in 12.5.** **Rows 1, 3 and 5 are a hierarchy, a missing record and a practice.** **Make the listener name which of the three each one is**, because the three have different remedies: a hierarchy needs somebody to act once, a missing record needs a return to be asked for, and a practice needs testing before it is believed.'));
